1
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:28,451
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,163
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,632
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,686
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:43,093
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:46,725
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,691
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:55,331
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,971
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,019
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,019 --> 00:01:07,971
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,163 --> 00:01:11,851
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,422
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,587 --> 00:01:22,531
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,979 --> 00:01:26,600
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,284
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,371 --> 00:01:35,299
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:39,459
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,755
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,424 --> 00:01:49,955
=Episode 5=

21
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:55,879
Governor. Miss Jiang is outside,
saying she needs to see you urgently.

22
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,359
Sorry to bother you, Governor.

23
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:07,319
It's just my father came to talk about
the wedding. He's been waiting a while.

24
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,000
When you'd be available, Governor?

25
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,120
President Jiang is here?

26
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:15,080
Yes.

27
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,439
Then I'll go meet him.

28
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,280
Take them away.

29
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:39,719
Young Marshal.

30
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,800
Please.

31
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,280
Mr. Rong.

32
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,120
Miss Jiang.

33
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:59,520
I just saw they caught someone
from the Rongqing Troupe.

34
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,879
- They're interrogating her now.
- Someone's alive?

35
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,039
Who is it?

36
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,039
I don't know either.

37
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,879
But what if she's tortured
into a false confession?

38
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:08,280
What if it's detrimental to you?

39
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:11,840
Just in case, maybe you should slip out
and lie low for a bit?

40
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,719
No, I can't run.

41
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:16,680
Whoever it is, I must rescue her.

42
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:25,759
Young Marshal, you should just confess.

43
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:27,479
Stop pretending.

44
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:34,240
Who else could steal my army emblem
to frame me besides you?

45
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,800
Young Marshal.

46
00:03:37,536 --> 00:03:40,599
Don't you know the Governor?

47
00:03:40,672 --> 00:03:44,240
You don't really think I'm the only one
who wants to kill you, huh?

48
00:03:47,264 --> 00:03:51,392
You're just a dog he keeps.

49
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,919
Don't flatter yourself.

50
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,479
So it was him all along.

51
00:03:57,280 --> 00:04:00,479
You're so desperate to climb over me.

52
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:08,400
Trying to get to him,
so you can ask for another bone?

53
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,240
You and I are both orphans he picked up.

54
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,720
I've been with the Governor
just as long as you have.

55
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:24,079
Why do you get to
keep being the Young Marshal?

56
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,639
Why do you get to
marry a rich man's daughter?

57
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,040
Why?

58
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,199
Exactly.

59
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:35,720
It's always the quiet dogs
that bite the hardest.

60
00:04:50,656 --> 00:04:51,839
He passed out.

61
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,319
Douse him awake!

62
00:04:56,928 --> 00:04:58,720
The Governor still
wants to interrogate him.

63
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,879
If the Young Marshal dies here now,

64
00:05:00,879 --> 00:05:02,800
the Governor will not
spare us if he finds out.

65
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:06,240
After interrogation and conviction,
we'll have more time to torture him.

66
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,160
You...

67
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,079
Young Marshal.

68
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,920
Young Marshal.

69
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:28,000
Young Marshal.

70
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,399
Young Marshal.

71
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:36,199
Why did you help Adjutant Zhao harm me?

72
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:42,439
Is it a threat with your life,
or a bribe with money?

73
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:43,264
Speak.

74
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:46,319
Or I'll strangle you right now.

75
00:05:55,264 --> 00:05:55,879
Who's there?

76
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:03,839
Down to this state,
and you're still bullying the weak.

77
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,984
Quite the man you are, Young Marshal.

78
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,079
Mr. Rong.

79
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:08,480
Are you okay?

80
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,240
Let's get you out of here first.

81
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,399
Get out?

82
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:16,800
Without me,
you'll just die somewhere else.

83
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,120
You're too arrogant.

84
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:23,600
You're no saint,
and you can't even save yourself.

85
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,160
What makes you think you can help me?

86
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:29,120
Even if you can
escape the Governor's Mansion, so what?

87
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:34,000
Where can you hide, and for how long?

88
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:40,319
Adjutant Zhao used her to set me up.
He's not going to leave any loose ends.

89
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:44,879
Xu Fan will never let this go either.

90
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,199
Set him up?

91
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,839
Yue Niang.

92
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,480
What's going on?

93
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:54,624
Mr. Rong, please save my child.

94
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:10,639
If you truly want to save her,
helping me is the only way.

95
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,800
Then I'll leave this matter to you.

96
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:20,800
- Governor! Governor!
- Leave this to me.

97
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:24,199
They tortured the Young Marshal.
Forcing a false confession.

98
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:28,319
The Young Marshal's unconscious
in jail. He's dying.

99
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:30,240
(Jiang Xiaoren)
Young Marshal?

100
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,720
(President of Fengcheng
Chamber of Commerce)

101
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,184
He's talking about You'an?

102
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,879
He's dying?

103
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:35,519
This...

104
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,319
You fool!

105
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:41,480
Who dared torture You'an
before the matter was investigated?

106
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:42,944
It was Adjutant Zhao.

107
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:45,480
He said it was under your orders.

108
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,680
Please investigate clearly.

109
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:50,519
March 16th, I was with the Young Marshal
inspecting the northern defenses.

110
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:56,279
I swear he never went to Rongqing Troupe
and met Head Rong.

111
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:02,240
The 16th of last month?

112
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,319
Wasn't that His Lordship's birthday?

113
00:08:06,279 --> 00:08:06,920
Dad.

114
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:10,040
Do you remember that day?
We all went to His Lordship's birthday.

115
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:13,920
We saw Rong Xiaonan and Head Rong there.
They were invited to perform.

116
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:17,480
So how could he have been
at the Rongqing Troupe?

117
00:08:18,624 --> 00:08:19,319
Right, right.

118
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,120
I remember now.

119
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,959
Dad.

120
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:23,800
There must be a misunderstanding.

121
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:27,879
He's hurt so close to the wedding.
Will it delay my auspicious wedding day?

122
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:30,600
Governor, this...

123
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,360
Go.

124
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:40,519
Have Adjutant Zhao bring the him out
and find a doctor to take a good look.

125
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,480
Yes.

126
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,912
Jiang.

127
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:52,440
Don't worry.

128
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,919
I will thoroughly
investigate this matter.

129
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,120
Move.

130
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:11,720
Only dead people can keep secrets.

131
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:15,039
You and your child should just die.

132
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:23,200
Quick, pick up the gun!

133
00:09:25,639 --> 00:09:28,919
Speak! Where is the child?

134
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:44,600
Governor.

135
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:47,519
No sign of the real Buddha Head
or the other artifacts.

136
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,519
I fear we won't be able to answer
to Xiaosheng Society or the Japanese.

137
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:24,384
Rong Xiaonan, shoot!

138
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,519
(Rong Xiaonan!)

139
00:10:32,352 --> 00:10:33,984
(It was Xu Fan who killed master.)

140
00:10:33,984 --> 00:10:35,136
Shoot!

141
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,456
Xu You'an.

142
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,840
- Mr. Rong, go quickly!
- Just die!

143
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:08,448
Mr. Rong, go quickly! Go save my child!

144
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,320
It was you.

145
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:24,840
It was you!

146
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:28,704
I will avenge my master
and everyone in the Rongqing Troupe!

147
00:11:36,416 --> 00:11:37,840
You're asking to die!

148
00:11:40,575 --> 00:11:42,377
♪Candle by the west window♪

149
00:11:42,377 --> 00:11:44,704
♪Burned out this life♪

150
00:11:45,265 --> 00:11:47,809
♪Ending in nothingness♪

151
00:11:48,071 --> 00:11:50,016
♪I ask why♪

152
00:11:50,368 --> 00:11:55,054
♪I yearn for the one who's gone
through heat and cold♪

153
00:11:55,392 --> 00:11:57,054
♪A handful of earth♪

154
00:11:57,248 --> 00:11:59,825
♪The world's last gamble♪

155
00:12:00,088 --> 00:12:03,750
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

156
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:10,240
♪No one comes to meet me♪

157
00:12:24,672 --> 00:12:26,501
♪Candle by the west window♪

158
00:12:26,501 --> 00:12:29,042
♪Burned out this life♪

159
00:12:29,344 --> 00:12:31,845
♪Ending in nothingness♪

160
00:12:32,083 --> 00:12:34,241
♪I ask why♪

161
00:12:34,592 --> 00:12:39,251
♪I yearn for the one who's gone
through heat and cold♪

162
00:12:39,616 --> 00:12:41,280
♪A handful of earth♪

163
00:12:41,472 --> 00:12:44,043
♪The world's last gamble♪

164
00:12:44,224 --> 00:12:47,328
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

165
00:12:48,768 --> 00:12:55,296
♪No one comes to meet me♪

166
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,360
♪As if it were fate♪

167
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,717
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

168
00:13:21,408 --> 00:13:24,516
♪We miss each other♪

169
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:27,328
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

170
00:13:27,328 --> 00:13:29,856
♪And a bizarre♪

171
00:13:29,856 --> 00:13:32,530
♪Anonymous legend♪

172
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:35,072
♪The plot twists and turns♪

173
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,960
♪Play out over and over again♪

174
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:40,024
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

175
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:42,304
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

176
00:13:42,304 --> 00:13:43,296
♪Refuse to submit♪

177
00:13:43,296 --> 00:13:46,496
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

178
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:51,072
♪There are always too many♪

179
00:13:51,072 --> 00:13:52,960
♪Helpless situations♪

180
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:55,584
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

181
00:13:56,715 --> 00:13:58,675
♪Even if I have questions♪

182
00:13:58,675 --> 00:14:00,675
♪I harbor desires♪

183
00:14:00,675 --> 00:14:03,552
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

184
00:14:03,903 --> 00:14:05,536
♪People come and go♪

185
00:14:05,536 --> 00:14:08,352
♪I'm still all alone♪

186
00:14:08,352 --> 00:14:11,080
♪Wandering around♪

187
00:14:11,328 --> 00:14:14,240
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

188
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:18,642
♪Go through the entanglement♪

189
00:14:19,008 --> 00:14:20,736
♪If longing♪

190
00:14:20,736 --> 00:14:23,895
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

191
00:14:23,895 --> 00:14:26,650
♪How can I be at ease♪

192
00:14:26,752 --> 00:14:29,066
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

193
00:14:29,184 --> 00:14:31,040
♪And travelled around the world♪

194
00:14:31,136 --> 00:14:34,224
♪Scars all over me♪

195
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:37,408
♪If longing never fades♪

196
00:14:37,408 --> 00:14:38,857
♪Burns still hot♪

197
00:14:38,857 --> 00:14:41,936
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

198
00:14:42,208 --> 00:14:44,065
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

199
00:14:44,128 --> 00:14:45,312
♪In the next life♪

200
00:14:45,312 --> 00:14:49,792
♪Entangle with you again♪
